  "description": "The development and portrayal of key characters for The Empire Strikes Back changed over the course of time. In an early draft of the screenplay, Han Solo found himself searching for an apparent Father-in-Law, Ovan Marekal, a man with political ties to Darth Vader. Jedi Master Yoda was also designed to be a bit different, described as a froglike creature named Minch in an early incarnation."
